<scroll-view class="page" scroll-y>
  <view class="announcement">
    <text class="announcement-label">公告</text>
    <view class="ticker-window">
      <view class="ticker-track">
        <text class="ticker-text">{{announcement}}</text>
        <text class="ticker-text">{{announcement}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="calculator">
    <view class="title">日本购物百货成本计算器</view>

    <view class="form">
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="label">含税原价</text>
        <view class="input-with-unit">
          <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.taxIncludedPrice}}" data-field="taxIncludedPrice" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
          <text class="input-unit">JPY</text>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="label">折扣（无折扣填1）</text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.discount}}" data-field="discount" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="label">刷卡汇率</text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.cardRate}}" data-field="cardRate" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="label">退税汇率</text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.rebateTaxRate}}" data-field="rebateTaxRate" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row">
        <text class="label">返点点数（2个点填0.02）</text>
        <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.rebatePoints}}" data-field="rebatePoints" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
      </view>
      <view class="form-row tax-fee-row">
        <view class="tax-fee-main">
          <view class="label-with-help">
            <text class="label">退税手续费</text>
            <view class="help-wrap">
              <text class="help-button" bindtap="toggleTaxFeeHelp">?</text>
            </view>
          </view>
          <view class="tax-fee-controls">
            <view class="currency-switch">
              <text class="currency-option {{form.taxFeeCurrency === 'CNY' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-currency="CNY" bindtap="onTaxFeeCurrencyChange">人民币（CNY）</text>
              <text class="currency-option {{form.taxFeeCurrency === 'JPY' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-currency="JPY" bindtap="onTaxFeeCurrencyChange">日元（JPY）</text>
            </view>
            <input class="input" type="digit" value="{{form.taxFee}}" data-field="taxFee" bindfocus="onInputFocus" bindinput="onInputChange" />
          </view>
        </view>
        <view wx:if="{{taxFeeHelpVisible}}" class="help-bubble">
          <text class="help-title">退税手续费费用说明</text>
          <text>日本购物退税会产生手续费，(包含1.2.3.4.)，本栏填写总的手续费，最终反回来的钱会少，少的金额，可自行填写。</text>
          <text>1. Processing Fee（处理费 / 业务办理费）</text>
          <text>2. Transaction Fee（交易手续费 / 支付通道费）</text>
          <text>3. Inter Remit Fee（中间行汇款费 / 跨境中转费）</text>
          <text>4. Consumption Tax (10%)（消费税 10%）</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <button class="calculate-button" bindtap="calculate">计算到手成本</button>

    <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="result">
      <view class="result-row"><text>到手税费</text><text>{{result.tax}} 元</text></view>
      <view class="result-row"><text>刷卡成本</text><text>{{result.cardCost}} 元</text></view>
      <view class="result-row"><text>返点</text><text>{{result.rebate}} 元</text></view>
      <view class="result-row"><text>退税手续费（人民币）</text><text>{{result.taxFee}} 元</text></view>
      <view class="final-row"><text>最终成本</text><text>{{result.finalCost}} 元</text></view>
    </view>

    <view class="formula">
      <text class="formula-title">公式：</text>
      <text>到手税费(人民币) = 含税价/1.1 × 折扣 × 0.1 × 0.77 × 退税汇率</text>
      <text>刷卡成本(人民币) = 含税价 × 折扣 × 刷卡汇率</text>
      <text>返点(人民币) = 含税价/1.1 × 折扣 × 返点点数 × 刷卡汇率</text>
      <text>最终成本 = 刷卡成本 - 到手税费 - 返点 + 退税手续费</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
